{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12244070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12244070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1224407001:1":{"text":"신밧드, 왜 여기에 숨어 있는 거예요? 한참을 찾았어요!","source_cn":"辛巴达，你怎么躲在这里？我们找了你好久！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x842FF176507F5C85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224407002:1":{"text":"날 왜 찾아? 지금쯤이면 광장에 가서 함께 떠들썩하게 즐겨야 할 때 아니야? 공개 재판은 흔히 있는 일이 아니라고.","source_cn":"干嘛来找我？现在这时间，你们该去广场上凑凑热闹。公审罪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6214827B5ADCACB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224407003:1":{"text":"말투를 듣자 하니, 저희랑 같이 가지 않으시려고요?","source_cn":"听你的语气，不打算和我们一起去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x645ACF2A3DFF2E58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224407004:1":{"text":"...그렇게 말하지는 않았는데.","source_cn":"……我没说这话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26C1DF98A4D42AFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1224407005:1":{"text":"말만 그렇게 안 했지, 그런 뜻이잖아요.","source_cn":"你是没这么说，但你就是这个意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB261C6E64E107BCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224407006:1":{"text":"마을 사람들 말로는 앞으로 일어날 일을 마주하기 힘들어서 그러는 거래요. 원래는 안 믿었는데, 지금 보니 정말 그런 것 같네요.","source_cn":"村里人说你不敢面对接下来会发生的事，本来我还不相信，现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C196648BD35522A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224407007:1":{"text":"하지만 전 이해가 안 돼요. 천하에 두려울 것 없는 신밧드가 대체 무얼 피하고 있는 거죠?","source_cn":"但漫漫想不通。天不怕地不怕的辛巴达，究竟在逃避什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03C31C4AF2FB65AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1224407007":{"text":"하지만 전 이해가 안 돼요. 천하에 두려울 것 없는 신밧드가 대체 무얼 피하고 있는 거죠?","source_cn":"但漫漫想不通。天不怕地不怕的辛巴达，究竟在逃避什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03C31C4AF2FB65AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1224407008:1":{"text":"소니아가 공정하게 처리할 거라고 믿어. 그러니 재판 결과에 대해서는 조금도 걱정하지 않아.","source_cn":"我相信索尼娅会公正处理这件事。所以我不担心公审结果，一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A51FCE15946347C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224407010:1":{"text":"...어쨌든, 그만 물어봐.","source_cn":"……总之，别问了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB3035DE33385DA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_femal